  "visual": {
    "visualType": "textbox",
    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Know the figures",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#1478BE"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Turnover is the BSC turnover: Oasis resignations for hospitals 1 to 5 and Fusion voluntary leavers for hospitals 6 to 8. The leaver figures marked in Fusion count Fusion leavers and do not reconcile with it; they are not scored.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Promotions are the Fusion PROMOTION action. HR to confirm that this is the definition they want.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Absence is not shown by department and payroll is not shown by job: the model has no department on the absence facts and no job on payroll.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Data quality: the records are rebuilt with the nightly build, so a fix at the source disappears on the next day's refresh. Records at Head Office are visible to administrators only.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Definitions lists every KPI and metric with its definition, formula, source and caveats; pick an Area to narrow it.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Questions, corrections, or a target to change: contact the BI manager.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
